WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.753
A woman walked out of a fancy building.

2
00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:19.692
She reached into her bag for a small mirror.

3
00:00:19.693 --> 00:00:23.088
"Wonderful!" she said.

4
00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:27.878
"That spa treatment is like magic. I look—"

5
00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:31.901
Suddenly she started to shake.

6
00:00:31.902 --> 00:00:36.845
She grew smaller and smaller. And then . . .

7
00:00:36.846 --> 00:00:40.603
"Goo-goo! Ga-ga!"

8
00:00:40.604 --> 00:00:45.493
"I love when Miss Apricot lets us have free time," Jack said.

9
00:00:45.494 --> 00:00:49.316
He was drawing a spaceship.

10
00:00:49.323 --> 00:00:51.423
Mara looked up from her book.

11
00:00:51.424 --> 00:00:54.808
"I'm just glad the school day is almost over.

12
00:00:54.809 --> 00:00:57.781
Did I tell you my big news?"

13
00:00:57.782 --> 00:01:01.497
Terrell raised an eyebrow. "What news?"

14
00:01:01.498 --> 00:01:04.151
"Tell us!" Roxy said.

15
00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:09.632
"I have a job," Mara said. "I start today after school!"

16
00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:12.366
"Whoa!" Jack said loudly.

17
00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:18.072
Miss Apricot looked up from her desk. "Shh!"

18
00:01:18.073 --> 00:01:24.260
"Sorry," Jack said. Then he looked back at Mara and whispered, "Whoa."

19
00:01:24.261 --> 00:01:29.565
"What's the job?" Terrell asked. "Will you be working in a store?"

20
00:01:29.566 --> 00:01:34.825
Jack grinned. "Will you be running a huge company, making millions of dollars?"

21
00:01:34.826 --> 00:01:39.100
"Are you going to be president?" Terrell asked.

22
00:01:39.101 --> 00:01:43.234
Jack and Terrell laughed.

23
00:01:43.235 --> 00:01:49.681
Mara rolled her eyes. "I'm going to be a mother's helper."

24
00:01:49.682 --> 00:01:54.709
"Cool!" Roxy said. "That's like babysitting, right?"

25
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:59.760
Mara nodded. "Yep! I'll be helping my neighbor Mrs. Garson.

26
00:01:59.761 --> 00:02:03.369
She needs me to watch her two-year-old while she plans a party.

27
00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:09.100
Mrs. Garson will be there though. So it's not exactly like babysitting."

28
00:02:09.101 --> 00:02:11.813
"I'd like to get a job," Jack said.

29
00:02:11.814 --> 00:02:14.312
"But I don't want to watch little kids.

30
00:02:14.313 --> 00:02:18.238
I'd rather run a huge company and make millions of dollars!"

31
00:02:18.239 --> 00:02:21.603
"Watching little kids is hard," Terrell said.

32
00:02:21.604 --> 00:02:25.287
"I bet Rocket Girl is great at it!"

33
00:02:25.288 --> 00:02:27.601
Mara rolled her eyes again.

34
00:02:27.602 --> 00:02:30.575
Roxy rolled her eyes too.

35
00:02:30.576 --> 00:02:36.085
"Rocket Girl has more important things to do than babysit, Terrell."

36
00:02:36.086 --> 00:02:41.322
Suddenly her watch beeped.

37
00:02:41.323 --> 00:02:44.903
Roxy asked Miss Apricot if she could go to the restroom.

38
00:02:44.904 --> 00:02:50.591
Then she stepped into the hallway.

39
00:02:50.592 --> 00:02:52.691
"Mayor Bloom," she said.

40
00:02:52.692 --> 00:02:57.474
"What's . . . Oh, wow! You look so young!"

41
00:02:57.475 --> 00:03:00.901
Mayor Bloom blushed. "Oh, thank you.

42
00:03:00.902 --> 00:03:06.429
I went to a spa this morning and got a special treatment. I feel wonderful!"

43
00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:09.787
"So what's the problem?" Roxy asked.

44
00:03:09.788 --> 00:03:12.750
Mayor Bloom looked confused for a moment.

45
00:03:12.751 --> 00:03:16.538
"Oh, right! Yes, we have a very odd problem, Rocket Girl.

46
00:03:16.539 --> 00:03:21.141
The owner of Metro City Plumbing Supply, Mr. Copper, has disappeared.

47
00:03:21.142 --> 00:03:25.546
And that's not all. There's a baby in his office."

48
00:03:25.547 --> 00:03:27.657
Roxy scratched her head.

49
00:03:27.658 --> 00:03:33.870
"That is odd. But don't worry, Mayor. I'll check it out."
